<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  We could not cancel your order
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Heads up
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We were unable to cancel your order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> because it is already
  <strong>{{order_status_label}}</strong>. At this stage the order can no longer be cancelled online.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Current status" value=order_status_label}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Need help?"}}
  Reply to this email if you need support with this order — for example a delivery issue or a return — and we will take care of you.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks for shopping with Dukka.
</p>
